'''Todomeki''' is an [[:Category:Uber Rare Cats|Uber Rare Cat]] that was added in [[Version 6.2 Update|Version 6.2]] and can be obtained by playing the [[Cat Capsule#Rare Capsule|Rare Capsule]] during the [[Merc Storia Collaboration Event]].

{{Cat Info
|ID = 346
|rarity = UR
|name1 = Todomeki
|name2 = Todomeki CC
}}

==Evolution==
Evolves into '''Todomeki CC''' at level 10.

==Strategy/Usage==
Todomeki is your average crowd-control Uber. Her generalist qualities are somewhere between [[Ururun Wolf (Special Cat)|Ururun Cat]] and Awakened Ururun, so she would be used more for her crowd-control than damage. Her most similar non-Uber counterpart is [[Talents|Talented]] [[Psychocat (Rare Cat)|Corrupted Psychocat]], both slowing Alien and Zombie enemies. The advantage Todomeki has are [[Area Attack|Area attacks]] with higher range, meaning she can better counter [[Ursamajor]] and [[Cadaver Bear]] while easily dealing with large crowds. Despite severe competition from other, arguably better Ubers such as [[Mekako Saionji (Uber Rare Cat)|Mission Control Mekako]] and various [[Nature's Guardians ELEMENTAL PIXIES (Gacha Event)|ELEMENTAL PIXIES]] along with the Super Rare units [[Vaulter Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Housewife Cat]] and [[Surfer Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Seafarer Cat]], Todomeki remains a valid answer to her trait targets, especially if the above units haven't been obtained yet.

{{Job|Classification = Crowd-Controller & Backliner}}

